    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present the fabulous Baden Lodge, Brownstown Little to the Kildare market. Whether you envision this property as an elegant family home, a boutique venue, or an exclusive retreat, the possibilities are endless. Nestled on a large site with beautiful grounds this magnificent family home is truly unique and will come as the dream family home for so many people. \nNestled amid rolling landscapes and mature greenery, this lovely three-bedroom home offers generous space, complete privacy, and a serene, calming atmosphere. It's the perfect retreat for those seeking to escape the hustle and bustle, yet it remains conveniently located within easy reach of nearby towns, schools, and excellent transport links. \nBright, airy & most stylish internal living accommodation of c 186 sqm compromises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, large open plan living/dining/kitchen area which leads out to a sunny private patio area, separate utility room, three double bedrooms (one master ensuite with walk in wardrobe and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. \nTucked away in a secure and gated ground you re truly spoiled with everything Baden Lodge has to offer, the front provides a low maintenance garden with artificial grass, you have as state of the art dog kennels to the rear which could be used for so many different purposes, on the grounds there is plenty of block built units for extra storage and one of them has been converted for the use of a home bar. \nIt's incredibly rare when a house like this comes to the market and it's a home where you have everything on your grounds. Baden Lodge comes to the market in turnkey condition throughout with no expense spared when upgrading or modifying in recent years with plenty of additional features such as top-quality fixtures & fittings, A-rated energy home, stunning fitted kitchen and generous bedrooms to name but a few, this one really needs to be seen to be appreciated. \nPlease contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to arrange a viewing. \nAdditional Features: \n- c. 186 sqm \n- BER A3\n- 3 BED 3 BATH house \n- Detached family home \n- Turnkey condition throughout \n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \n- Top quality fixtures & fittings \n- Magnificent property \n- Ample parking \n- Mature & peaceful surroundings \n- Secure and gated property \n- Large maintenance free garden to the front \n- State of the art dog kennels to the rear \n- Ample amounts of storage \n- Block built units to the rear \n- Full sized bar with decking area \n- Ample amounts of parking \n- Large open plan living/dining/kitchen \n- Beautiful fully fitted kitchen \n- Separate utility room \n- Three generous bedrooms \n- Built in wardrobes \n- Walk in wardrobe \n- Master ensuite \n- Fully tiled main family bath \n- Guest bathroom \n- Fantastic location \n- 30km from Dublin City \n- Unique family home \n- Viewing highly advised\nDirections - R56P389\n"
      },
